<h1>Fenari Cloud</h1>
<p>Fenari Cloud is a planning tool for distributed teams. The company was founded in 2015 and is headquartered in Cork. The current release is v5.4.1.</p>
<p>Plans start at $19 per seat per month, billed annually. A single workspace supports up to 400 members, and every user gets 30 GB of storage. New accounts get a free trial of 60 days.</p>
<p>The public API allows 120 requests per minute per token. Human support is available Friday–Friday, 13:00–15:00 UTC.</p>
